younger, to protect their heads.

00:12:31.866 --> 00:12:35.160
Are you concerned about
that and some of the issues

00:12:35.160 --> 00:12:37.380 position:56%
that have been raised about concerns

00:12:37.380 --> 00:12:41.370 position:66%
