00:12:49.140 --> 00:12:52.920
but it is more than
reasonable to be concerned

00:12:52.920 --> 00:12:55.980 position:63%
about the long-term effects of the game,

00:12:55.980 --> 00:12:59.640
especially in this current
climate where it's, you know

00:12:59.640 --> 00:13:03.138
