00:13:17.280 --> 00:13:22.170 position:64%
So it is more than sensible or reasonable

00:13:22.170 --> 00:13:25.357
to be concerned with that.

00:13:25.357 --> 00:13:28.530
What I would say, and
the only caveat to that

00:13:28.530 --> 00:13:31.470
