them to come off the field

00:14:28.350 --> 00:14:30.810
as a result of their head knock.

00:14:30.810 --> 00:14:34.200
However, now it's almost
the complete opposite.

00:14:34.200 --> 00:14:36.720 position:63%
Once someone has a head knock, you know,

00:14:36.720 --> 00:14:38.407 position:64%
your teammates are no longer telling you,

00:14:38.407 --> 00:14:40.218
"Hey, come on, get up,
get up, we need you."

00:14:40.218 --> 00:14:44.108
They're thinking about that
person or that individual first.

00:14:44.108 --> 00:14:47.010 position:63%
They're saying, "No, you need to get out

00:14:47.010 --> 00:14:48.609 position:66%
