00:15:37.459 --> 00:15:41.040
I know there's a scrum hat

00:15:41.040 --> 00:15:44.520 position:63%
on the market now that makes that claim.

00:15:44.520 --> 00:15:49.140
However, I'm not too sure on,
you know, the actual, you know

00:15:49.140 --> 00:15:51.343
